      text: Siebel Apps - Clinical Trials Management System 36100318 Site Management For the Clinical one integrated Studies, when a new SVT version is updated, only for Visits where the ‘Repeating’ flag is Y, the Completed and Completed date values must be reset. So after Scheduling the Subject, data should be retained for Static visit ONLY, but Master visit data should be reset (which in case is not happening and system is resetting the 'Completed' flag and 'Completed Date' for both the Visits where Repeating flag is Y and N). A fix has been provided to address this issue.
